owing_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VicooDi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VicooDi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VicooDi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VicooDi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VicooDi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VicooDi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VicooDi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VicooDi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98308#pullrequestreview-2378965865","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/98308","author_association":"NONE","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98308#pullrequestreview-2378965865"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/98308"}},"submitted_at":"2024-10-18T21:05:54Z","commit_id":"bfbd8741a7742a170c710ca8bc010f4d07092eed"},{"id":2379011711,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6NzNZ_","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?u=9b90963f1b4f17720e50bbbe495fbe8c84c8bc8e&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98308#pullrequestreview-2379011711","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/98308","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98308#pullrequestreview-2379011711"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/98308"}},"submitted_at":"2024-10-18T21:49:25Z","commit_id":"bfbd8741a7742a170c710ca8bc010f4d07092eed"},{"id":2379047909,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6NzWPl","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?u=9b90963f1b4f17720e50bbbe495fbe8c84c8bc8e&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"I recall that there is a problem in the inspector with normalization immediately after a set.\r\n\r\n1. The phase (sign) can be inverted unintentionally\r\n\r\nQuaternions can have phase inverted states for the same rotational state when they are static and not interpolated. Implicit normalization can cause sudden positive/negative inversions, which can break animation keys and editing by dragging. This is related to the nan issue you comment on in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98090#issuecomment-2422990025.\r\n\r\n2. If the moment you set one element, the other elements change on their own, you will not be able to enter a specific quaternion manually\r\n\r\nSimilar to above, but this means that it is necessary to temporarily accept an unnormalized quaternion to allow manual input.\r\n\r\nFor example, if you want to enter the value `Quaternion(0.5, 0.0, 0.5, 0.0)`, the element changes when you enter `0.5` for x. If you change x to `0.5` and then change y, the x value changes again. This is an unacceptable problem.\r\n\r\n3. The behavior is not consistent with Quaternion elsewhere\r\n\r\nIf you could prevent flipping the positive and negative, you might be able to do normalization immediately after input, but this would not be consistent with other places, and you might want it in other places. For example, when editing a key on the Rotation3DTrack.\r\n\r\nTherefore, when implementing normalization, the Quaternion property should be hinted to perform normalization by PropertyHint, which will then perform normalization within the EditorPropertyQuaternion.\r\n\r\nAlthough there are few cases where an unnormalized Quaternion is needed, it is necessary to accept the unnormalized state as well, since it is possible to have temporary unnormalized states during nlerp() and slerp() calculations. However, for Skeleton's pose, a broken Quaternion should not be set and the set should be aborted with an error.\r\n\r\n--- \r\n\r\nFinally, the one part of the correct approaches is not to normalize the quaternion in the setter, but rather to generate an ERROR and not accept the broken quaternion.\r\n\r\nThis can coexist with the normalization of the EditorPropertyQuaternion, so the PR can be split into two:\r\n\r\n1. Add hint, normalization and temporary Quaternion editor to EditorPropertyQuaternion\r\n2. Make error when setting un-normalized quaternion in set_bone_pose_rotation()\r\n\r\nHowever, note that the modification of the EditorPropertyQuaternion must be implemented first, since a temporary un-normalized quaternion for manual input must be allowed, without which manual input cannot be performed due to errors. Probably need to add an editor like temporary QuaternionEditor that can switch with temporary EulerEditor.\r\n","state":"CHANGES_REQUESTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98308#pullrequestreview-2379047909","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/98308","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98308#pullrequestreview-2379047909"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/98308"}},"submitted_at":"2024-10-18T22:32:50Z","commit_id":"bfbd8741a7742a170c710ca8bc010f4d07092eed"},{"id":2379119706,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6Nznxa","user":{"login":"VicooDi","id":49839465,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5ODM5NDY1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/49839465?u=c81fcc97f31a975ab31a2dd5dbd676a0c3baaea2&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/VicooDi","html_url":"https://github.com/VicooDi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VicooDi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VicooDi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VicooDi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VicooDi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VicooDi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VicooDi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VicooDi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VicooDi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VicooDi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98308#pullrequestreview-2379119706","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/98308","author_association":"NONE","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98308#pullrequestreview-2379119706"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/98308"}},"submitted_at":"2024-10-18T23:46:14Z","commit_id":"bfbd8741a7742a170c710ca8bc010f4d07092eed"},{"id":2379147071,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6Nzuc_","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?u=9b90963f1b4f17720e50bbbe495fbe8c84c8bc8e&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98308#pullrequestreview-2379147071","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/98308","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98308#pullrequestreview-2379147071"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/98308"}},"submitted_at":"2024-10-19T00:50:33Z","commit_id":"bfbd8741a7742a170c710ca8bc010f4d07092eed"},{"id":2379808253,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6N2P39","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?u=9b90963f1b4f17720e50bbbe495fbe8c84c8bc8e&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"","state":"CHANGES_REQUESTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98308#pullrequestreview-2379808253","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/98308","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98308#pullrequestreview-2379808253"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/98308"}},"submitted_at":"2024-10-19T23:57:15Z","commit_id":"79954732c3ad8e25f130da43baa81c3bb988ce6a"},{"id":2380922388,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6N6f4U","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?u=9b90963f1b4f17720e50bbbe495fbe8c84c8bc8e&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This approach does not solve the problem of the quaternions being normalized on their own in Node3D and not being able to enter quaternions manually. In other words, one of the following two approaches must be chosen:\r\n\r\n1. If we add a normalization button, we must remove the implicit normalization in Node3D\r\n\r\n2. If we add the temporary Quaternion editor, we will need to add either implicit normalization or rejection of unnormalized quaternions due to error to Bone Pose\r\n\r\nSince this is a pretty fundamental design issue, it seems to me that we need to have a discussion with @reduz about which approach to choose\r\n\r\nIn the case of 1, unintended normalization or errors may occur during processing unrelated directly to the quaternion set, so I personally prefer 2 as the safer choice.\r\n\r\nAt worst, I think it is possibly acceptable to change length_squared and length, but I still think there are causes elsewhere, such as the trigonometric calculations. length is very slightly more computationally expensive than length_squared (but due to the many locations where it is used, the performance degradation could be noticeable depending on the algorithm), and is not consistent with other linear arithmetic classes.","state":"CHANGES_REQUESTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98308#pullrequestreview-2380922388","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/98308","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98308#pullrequestreview-2380922388"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/98308"}},"submitted_at":"2024-10-21T04:58:05Z","commit_id":"d39089466b55ef00a00e80a2b446747e2b56a1ab"},{"id":2860716113,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6qgxBR","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?u=9b90963f1b4f17720e50bbbe495fbe8c84c8bc8e&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"#106352 is proper solution to fix #98090. However, I agree with the addition of a normalize button as an input usability, so I think this PR should dedicate to that button addition purpose.","state":"CHANGES_REQUESTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98308#pullrequestrevi